    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_delayedPCP",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID4",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Debrief",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">Thank you &mdash; what this study was about</h3><p>Now that you have finished, here is the full purpose of the research. The chart-reading sessions were part of a study on how different digital tools (web search versus AI assistants) affect how well people <em>learn</em> to read parallel-coordinates charts. The questions you just answered without any tools measured what you retained, and this second session &mdash; about three days after the first &mdash; measured how durable that learning was.</p><p>We described the sessions as a &ldquo;task&rdquo; rather than a &ldquo;test&rdquo; because we wanted to observe natural learning rather than test-focused studying. The existence of this second session was disclosed when you signed up. Your responses are anonymised and analysed only in aggregate.</p><p style=\"color:#666\">[Researcher to add: CUREC ethics reference and a contact email here before launch.]</p><p>Thank you for taking part.</p>",
        "QuestionText_Unsafe": "<h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">Thank you &mdash; what this study was about</h3><p>Now that you have finished, here is the full purpose of the research. The chart-reading sessions were part of a study on how different digital tools (web search versus AI assistants) affect how well people <em>learn</em> to read parallel-coordinates charts. The questions you just answered without any tools measured what you retained, and this second session &mdash; about three days after the first &mdash; measured how durable that learning was.</p><p>We described the sessions as a &ldquo;task&rdquo; rather than a &ldquo;test&rdquo; because we wanted to observe natural learning rather than test-focused studying. The existence of this second session was disclosed when you signed up. Your responses are anonymised and analysed only in aggregate.</p><p style=\"color:#666\">[Researcher to add: CUREC ethics reference and a contact email here before launch.]</p><p>Thank you for taking part.</p>",
